  "goodToKnow": "Die Justizvollzugsanstalt, abbreviated JVA, is the official German term for a prison. Everyday speech says das Gefängnis or colloquially der Knast. Der Strafvollzug is the serving of sentences, and German law names rehabilitation (Resozialisierung) as its goal. Prisons are run by the Länder. Plural: die Justizvollzugsanstalten."
